 "comments": [
  {
   "rating": 42,
   "date": "2006-12-11T00:19:29-06:00",
   "body": "This turnin for texts doesn't give any Cenarion rep, but he sometimes sends you shadow resist tailoring and smithing patterns in the mail. Patterns are fairly cheap on the AH though, so generally better off giving the texts to the Cenarion guy.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 11,
   "date": "2005-10-15T01:32:14-05:00",
   "body": "Decoded Twilight Text - Random twilight letters\nScroll: Create Signet of Beckoning\nScroll: Create Scepter of Beckoning\nScroll: Create Crest of Beckoning\nScroll of Agility IV\nScroll of Protection IV\n[url=/item=20548] Pattern: Runed Stygian Belt[/url]\n[url=/item=20546]Pattern: Runed Stygian Leggings[/url]\n[url=/item=20547]Pattern: Runed Stygian Boots[/url]\n[url=/item=20555]Plans: Darkrune Helm[/url]\n[url=/item=20553]Plans: Darkrune Gauntlets[/url]\n[url=/item=20554]Plans: Darkrune Breastplate[/url]\n\n\nEdited, Sun Oct 16 09:37:49 2005",
   "replies": [
    "I wonder why there are no mail and no leather shadow resist tradeskill items."
   ]
  },
  {
   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2007-01-03T20:07:03-06:00",
