   "body": "\"Additional Tailoring and Blacksmithing recipes can be found in encoded messages found on the members of the Twilight's Hammer in Silithus. \"\n\nthis is from the patch notes... so im guessing that what you get in the mail has the chance to contain recipes? the guy in cenraion hold that you turn it in to only gives you faction as far as im aware.... i guess we'll have to wait and see.",
