   "rating": -4,
   "date": "2005-11-06T05:50:44-06:00",
   "body": "Ive given Ortell about 200 Encrypted Messages. IE: Done the quest about 20 times.\n\nIve gotten pattern for:\n2x Darkrune Breastplate\n1x Darkrune Helmet\n1x Runed Stygian Belt\n1x Runed Stygian Leggings\n2x Runed Stygian Boots\n\nI originaly did this quest to get the Runed Stygian patterns. So Im quite happy! And the Darkrune plans sold for quite alot at the AH :D",
