  {
   "rating": -12,
   "date": "2005-10-25T15:22:29-05:00",
   "body": "what are the signet sceotre and crest's of beckoning for ?...got the scroll to make the crest of bekoning thunder last night",
   "replies": [
    "Normally when you summon a templar/duke/lord of the Abyssal Council, it's a random chance for one of the four elements. \n\nIf you have a Crest of Beckoning: Fire, for example, you have the option to call forth a Crimson Templar specifically (you can also still do it random and save the crest). Note: You [i]do[/i] still need a set of Twilight Cultist armor and the crest/signet/scepter [i]is[/i] consumed along with the armor.\n\nCrests for Templars, Signets for Dukes, Scepters for Lords. If you're next going to ask why... first, some elements are easier than others, and second, each boss (even the "
   ]
